A Possible re-run of mode-5 could use NZDUSD at the 6-hour timeframe. This slower chart could leave enough time to get divergences while a different currency and session profile would test if the used membrane state can be relied on beyond USDCAD. In addition, this test run should have as many trades as possible, at least
25
